#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libavif"
msgstr "Instalação do libavif"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix a build failure with SVT-AV1-4.0.0 or newer:"
msgstr "Corrija uma falha de construção com SVT-AV1-4.0.0 ou mais novos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed 's/enable_adaptive_quantization/aq_mode/' -i "
"src/codec_svt.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed 's/enable_adaptive_quantization/aq_mode/' -i "
"src/codec_svt.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libavif</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libavif</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_AOM=SYSTEM     \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_DAV1D=SYSTEM   \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_SVT=SYSTEM     \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=OFF \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF           \\\n"
"      -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_AOM=SYSTEM     \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_DAV1D=SYSTEM   \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_CODEC_SVT=SYSTEM     \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=OFF \\\n"
"      -D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF           \\\n"
"      -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the package (note that it will cause the build system to download a "
"copy of <ulink url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> "
"and build the test suite with the copy), issue:"
msgstr ""
"Para testar o pacote (observe que isso fará com que o sistema de construção "
"baixe uma cópia do <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/googletest\">gtest</ulink> e construa a "
"suíte de teste com a cópia), emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D AVIF_GTEST=LOCAL -D AVIF_BUILD_TESTS=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D AVIF_GTEST=LOCAL -D AVIF_BUILD_TESTS=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_CODEC_{AOM,DAV1D,SVT}=SYSTEM</parameter>: These switches "
"enable using the AV1 codec via dav1d, libaom, and SVT-AV1. This package is "
"useless without an AV1 encoder and decoder."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_CODEC_{AOM,DAV1D,SVT}=SYSTEM</parameter>: Essas chaves "
"habilitam usar o codec de AV1 via dav1d, libaom e SVT-AV1. Esse pacote é "
"inútil sem um codificador e decodificador de AV1."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables "
"building the AVIF loader for applications which use gdk-pixbuf.  The loader "
"is useless when gdk-pixbuf is built with its recommended dependency glycin."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D AVIF_BUILD_GDK_PIXBUF=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"construir o carregador AVIF para aplicativos que usam gdk-pixbuf. O "
"carregador é inútil quando o gdk-pixbuf é construído com a dependência "
"recomendada dele, glycin."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF</option>: Use this switch if you have not "
"installed <ulink "
"url=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/libyuv/libyuv/\">libyuv</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D AVIF_LIBYUV=OFF</option>: Use essa chave se você não tiver "
"instalado <ulink "
"url=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/libyuv/libyuv/\">libyuv</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/libavif.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_RAV1E=SYSTEM</option>: Use this switch if you have "
"installed <ulink url=\"https://github.com/xiph/rav1e\">rav1e</ulink> and "
"wish to use it as a codec."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D AVIF_CODEC_RAV1E=SYSTEM</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado <ulink url=\"https://github.com/xiph/rav1e\">rav1e</ulink> e "
"desejar usá-lo como um codificador."

